<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>$FISH — Neko, the Fastest Cat in the Mempool</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Big+Shoulders+Display:wght@600;800&family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&display=swap');

  :root{
    --harbor: #0F2A3D;
    --harbor-deep: #0A1E2C;
    --dock: #C9A876;
    --paper: #F2E9D8;
    --sardine: #B8C4CC;
    --bandana: #C23B2E;
    --ink: #17232B;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }

  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body{
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .display{
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    line-height: 0.92;
  }

  a{ color: inherit; }

  .wrap{
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 28px;
  }

  nav{
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    background: var(--harbor);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--bandana);
  }
  nav .wrap{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 14px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--paper);
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 26px;
  }
  .brand .tag{
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--dock);
  }
  nav ul{
    list-style:none;
    display:flex;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  nav ul a{
    color: var(--sardine);
    text-decoration:none;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  nav ul a:hover{ color: var(--paper); }

  header.hero{
    background: var(--harbor);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 72px 0 96px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  header.hero::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    left:0; right:0; bottom:0;
    height: 18px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--dock) 0 40px, var(--harbor-deep) 40px 42px);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  .hero-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    color: var(--dock);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  h1.display{
    font-size: clamp(52px, 8vw, 96px);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  h1.display span{ color: var(--dock); }
  .hero p.lead{
    font-size: 19px;
    max-width: 46ch;
    color: var(--sardine);
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .cta-row{ display:flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn{
    display:inline-block;
    padding: 13px 26px;
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    text-decoration:none;
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
  }
  .btn-primary{ background: var(--bandana); color: var(--paper); }
  .btn-primary:hover{ background: #a72f24; }
  .btn-ghost{ border-color: var(--sardine); color: var(--paper); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ border-color: var(--paper); }

  .hero-art{
    background: var(--dock);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 6px;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
  }
  .hero-art img{
    width:100%;
    display:block;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .hero-art .cap{
    font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 8px 4px 2px;
  }

  .strip{
    background: var(--dock);
    color: var(--ink);
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 10px 0;
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .strip span{ margin: 0 24px; }

  section{ padding: 84px 0; }
  section.alt{ background: #EADFC7; }

  h2.display{
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 48px);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .lore-block{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 52px;
    align-items:start;
  }
  .lore-block p{ margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 17px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .lore-block .pull{
    border-left: 3px solid var(--bandana);
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--harbor);
    margin: 26px 0;
  }

  .cast{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .cast article{
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid #d8cba9;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .cast h3{
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--harbor);
  }
  .cast p{ font-size: 15px; color: #40372a; }

  .how-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .how-step{
    background: var(--harbor);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 26px 22px;
  }
  .how-step .n{
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 40px;
    color: var(--dock);
    display:block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .how-step h3{ font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .how-step p{ font-size: 14px; color: var(--sardine); }

  .stats{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid #c9bb96;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #c9bb96;
  }
  .stat{
    padding: 26px 18px;
    border-right: 1px solid #c9bb96;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .stat:last-child{ border-right:none; }
  .stat .num{
    font-family: 'Big Shoulders Display', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 30px;
    color: var(--bandana);
  }
  .stat .label{ font-size: 13px; color: #55503f; margin-top: 4px; }

  footer{
    background: var(--harbor-deep);
    color: var(--sardine);
    padding: 40px 0 28px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  footer .disclaimer{
    font-size: 13px;
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 0 auto 18px;
    color: #7a8d99;
  }
  footer .socials{ display:flex; gap:20px; justify-content:center; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  footer .socials a{ text-decoration:none; color: var(--paper); font-size: 15px; }

  @media (max-width: 760px){
    .hero-grid, .lore-block, .cast, .how-grid, .stats{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stat{ border-right:none; border-bottom: 1px solid #c9bb96; }
    nav ul{ gap: 16px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand">大漁 NEKO <span class="tag">$FISH</span></div>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#lore">Lore</a></li>
      <li><a href="#cast">Harbor</a></li>
      <li><a href="#buy">Get $FISH</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Satoshi Harbor · fully on-chain since block one</p>
      <h1 class="display">The cat that <span>front-runs</span> breakfast.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Neko doesn't wait in the mempool. Every catch that hits the dock, he takes first — and now the whole harbor trades on it. $FISH is the token of the fastest paw in Web3.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="#buy" class="btn btn-primary">Get $FISH</a>
        <a href="#lore" class="btn btn-ghost">Read the lore</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art">
      <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3a/Cat_November_2010-1a.jpg" alt="Neko the cat">
      <p class="cap">Neko, mid-heist, Satoshi Harbor docks.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="strip">
  <span>$FISH</span><span>大漁 = GREAT CATCH</span><span>PROOF OF PAW</span><span>$FISH</span><span>MEV IS A CAT NOW</span><span>$FISH</span><span>大漁 = GREAT CATCH</span><span>PROOF OF PAW</span><span>$FISH</span><span>MEV IS A CAT NOW</span>
</div>

<section id="lore">
  <div class="wrap lore-block">
    <div>
      <h2 class="display">Every harbor needs a validator nobody asked for.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Satoshi Harbor runs like any market: fishermen deposit the day's catch into the mempool, and it waits its turn to be weighed, priced, and sold. Orderly. Predictable. Slow.</p>
      <p>Neko broke that the first week he showed up. Bandana tied, claws sharp, he takes the freshest fish before it's even confirmed — a front-run nobody can stop, because nobody can catch him.</p>
      <p class="pull">"He's not stealing fish. He's just faster than the block time." — a dockworker, still out of breath</p>
      <p>$FISH exists because the harbor decided to stop fighting it and start trading on it. Every heist is a story. Every story is a chart. Hold $FISH, hold the harbor's favorite chaos.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats alt">
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">1B</div><div class="label">total $FISH supply</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">0%</div><div class="label">buy / sell tax</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">100%</div><div class="label">liquidity locked</div></div>
  <div class="stat"><div class="num">1</div><div class="label">unstoppable cat</div></div>
</section>

<section id="cast">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="display">Cast of the harbor</h2>
    <div class="cast">
      <article>
        <h3>Neko</h3>
        <p>Youngest validator ever to pass proof-of-paw. Runs on instinct, sardines, and zero regard for confirmation times.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Pak Kenji</h3>
        <p>The harbor's official block validator. Has chased Neko across every dock in town and confirmed exactly zero transactions in the process.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>The gulls</h3>
        <p>Self-appointed observer nodes. They witness every heist, and their squawking is the closest thing this harbor has to a public ledger.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="buy" class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="display">Join the mempool</h2>
    <div class="how-grid">
      <div class="how-step">
        <span class="n">01</span>
        <h3>Get a wallet</h3>
        <p>Set up a wallet that supports the chain $FISH lives on. Fund it with a little gas.</p>
